---
layout: layouts/01-shell.njk
permalink: 01-dithered-ink/archive.html
title: 归档
description: EchoTouch 博客全部文章归档，按栏目整理。
current: archive
---
<h1 class="page-title">文章归档</h1>
<p class="intro">按栏目分类整理，记录技术分析与日常感悟。</p>

<section class="archive-column">
  <h2 class="archive-column-title">技术分析 <span class="column-count">({{ (collections.posts | byCategory('技术分析')).length }} 篇)</span></h2>
  <div class="entry-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts | byCategory('技术分析') %}
      <article class="entry">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        <div>
          <h2><a href="{{ post | postUrl(sites.ink.path) | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
          <p class="summary">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    {% else %}
      <p class="empty-hint">暂无技术分析文章</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="archive-column">
  <h2 class="archive-column-title">日常感悟 <span class="column-count">({{ (collections.posts | byCategory('日常感悟')).length }} 篇)</span></h2>
  <div class="entry-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts | byCategory('日常感悟') %}
      <article class="entry">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        <div>
          <h2><a href="{{ post | postUrl(sites.ink.path) | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
          <p class="summary">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    {% else %}
      <p class="empty-hint">暂无日常感悟文章</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<p class="backlink"><a href="{{ ('/' ~ sites.ink.path ~ '/') | url }}">← 返回首页</a></p>
